    "b-kn-intro": {
      "id": "b-kn-intro",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The Knowledge System is the harness's expert memory for the codebase. It records what functions, data, translation units, structs, fields, and game concepts mean, how strongly each interpretation is supported, and what has already been tried. Beliefs, attempt history, operational events, the raw knowledge sources, and derived projections live in separate tables so each is searched and maintained by its own truth model."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-kn-taxonomy": {
      "id": "b-kn-taxonomy",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Raw material lives in five knowledge sources, in two classes. Archival sources (Discord, pull requests, wiki) are frozen once ingested: new material appends rows and gets them indexed, existing rows never change. Operational sources (attempts and code) grow with the run itself; code is the only source that drifts. Every claim in the graph cites into a source through a typed locator. Standards are part of the knowledge system but outside the knowledge graph: QA-owned authored rules, injected at worker boot and enforced at the ship gate, never citable as evidence."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-kn-where": {
      "id": "b-kn-where",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "The store is one SQLite file per game, "
        },
        {
          "insert": "games/melee/knowledge/knowledge.sqlite",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "games/melee/knowledge/knowledge.sqlite",
              "label": "games/melee/knowledge/knowledge.sqlite"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", with a rebuildable search index beside it. The code is "
        },
        {
          "insert": "apps/server/src/core/knowledge-v2",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "source",
              "path": "apps/server/src/core/knowledge-v2",
              "label": "apps/server/src/core/knowledge-v2"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "; the agents that write to it are in "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Agents",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "doc",
              "path": "10-system-design/45-agents",
              "label": "Agents"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
